This is critical.

Strategy says BUY
       ↓
Risk Engine
       ↓
"Allowed?"

It can reject the trade.

For example:

Strategy:
BUY

Risk Engine:
Daily loss limit reached
→ REJECT

Or:

Strategy:
BUY

Risk Engine:
Position already exists
→ REJECT

Or:

Strategy:
BUY

Risk Engine:
Stop distance too large
→ REJECT

The AI should never be able to override the risk engine.
